{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"5b545f66332a1a406020e9f84324db0b3ace89eb3b63233f266118df59dc4f81","ja":"応援団長就任！","zh":"担任啦啦队队长！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"a2b068a2f1ea41453f493a5cfdd5771a8c349eda875e8d0f9d22da0895c8c675","ja":"かっ飛ばせ～！　765プロっ！！！\nいいぞ、いいぞ！　765プロ～っ！！！","zh":"击出全垒打吧～！　765事务所！！！\n加油、加油！　765事务所～！！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2ff15cc9a6083ebe810397183a808fc1412dab18e7f5f05309d2d64e1d8a2c9c","ja":"どうしたの、昴？\n大きな声出して。","zh":"怎么了，昴？\n喊这么大声。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7224382adc4dffa8fcbf1c01a5b63bafbf4e4098b40dd861cb1ac1cbe2cc4b56","ja":"へへっ♪　実は、この前のダンスバトルのお陰で\nオファーをもらったんだ！","zh":"嘿嘿♪　其实多亏了之前的街舞对决，\n我拿到工作邀约了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"19cc47c626eaa3b31e1c08650877a96dff898442be681a555aefed74d5b5e1ff","ja":"番組で応援団長をしてくれってさ！","zh":"说是要让我在节目里担任应援团长！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"beae969fa4d31f45b8f2d251476756af1503bce534dfd41da4f7649689bc3904","ja":"わあ、おめでとう！\n昴ちゃんの応援って、すごく気合いが入るもんね。","zh":"哇，恭喜你！\n小昴的加油打气，真的很让人干劲十足呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5c4cfaccacbfb6c55dede6ea7ed1da98d1541f70d05e9e4fd74988929ea4b31b","ja":"サンキュー！\nオレ、ビシッとかっこよくきめようと思っててさ♪","zh":"谢啦！\n我正想着要帅气地大显身手呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"0ee3b770b7c84715a6703ce33fecd722166ed562e79741221dc7244ce0994e6b","ja":"あれ？　でも、昴のチアダンスを見て\n依頼してくれたなら、応援もチアなんじゃないの？","zh":"咦？不过，如果是看了昴跳啦啦队舞才\n发来委托的，那加油不也应该是啦啦队吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"d15588f0e2eadc286edcc78202857cd601e6a1b8ac20ce373b3d253f07c00821","ja":"ええっ、そうなのか！？　\n応援団長って言うからてっきり……。","zh":"咦，是这样吗！？\n听到应援团长，我还以为……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"0e499ef36fff35d3ecb22029d61430f41117a26164b0bf893064868e68f1b702","ja":"昴ちゃん、それってどういう番組なの？","zh":"昂，那是档什么样的节目啊？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"f528c32f414aa6333bdded7e46f9e9e326a22f457ef4c9c72d9e089c684b856b","ja":"たしか、いろんなスポーツの選手が\nいろんな競技で争う……みたいなのだったかな。","zh":"我记得好像是各种体育项目的选手\n在不同的竞技项目中比拼……之类的吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"193a852163355f1a493bb6be7fe705e4a3e358a4a936d66f910d930acc920607","ja":"あっ、やっぱり！　その番組って\nチアで応援してるはずだよ！","zh":"啊，果然是！那个节目\n应该是用啦啦队加油助威的吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4573c061dbb872219ea71f1dcdb2561b011938596c8b51b2eb3873a573f9cef0","ja":"毎回アイドルが出演して、かわいく応援するのが、\n見どころのひとつになってたんじゃないかな？","zh":"每次都有偶像出演，可爱地为选手加油，\n这也是看点之一吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1293.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"84abb4565c586a4df3c4b160fd846a4b27e9941f6b22a7b9471eeb3ed521a709","ja":"ええーっ！　やっぱ、そうなんだ！\n次はかっこよく応援できると思ったのにーっ！！","zh":"诶——！果然是那样啊！\n明明还以为下次就能帅气地为你加油了——！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
